// Canonical source: a member with no access attribute is package access,
// open to "all methods defined in the same package and sub-packages" (thesis
// line 731). Box's own method reads inner, and shown is public, but from this
// unit, outside package PkgLib, box.inner is refused.
// Units: bml-class-package-lib.bml
// Answer: "BML-HATI-UNSUPPORTED access/package"
import PkgLib.*;
Box box = new Box();
return box.Inner() + box.shown + box.inner;
